{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_7ygf2dg6m2mlj56lkb4vqvw3woahim624ylzhkfmetpk5grcu6ir","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I built all 12 Nectar screens, a reusable component library and the clickable prototype in **03 · Workspace**, using the account hejiatong@tetras.ai. I took a screenshot of every screen and fixed the problems I saw. The reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were not changed.\n\n- **File:** https://www.figma.com/design/UlgozbXKKfkCkJL2xcXBBr/\n- **03 · Workspace page ID:** `7:2`\n\n**Screen IDs**\n\n| Frame | ID | Frame | ID |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01_Splash | `16:263` | 07_Explore | `20:547` |\n| 02_Onboarding | `16:292` | 08_Beverages | `20:623` |\n| 03_Sign_In | `16:316` | 09_My_Cart | `20:715` |\n| 04_Verification | `16:354` | 10_Checkout_Overlay | `20:858` |\n| 05_Home (414×1507, scrolls) | `18:354` | 11_Order_Accepted | `20:901` |\n| 06_Product_Detail | `18:513` | 12_Account | `20:938` |\n\n**Design system** (section \"Nectar Components\", `10:2`)\n- **Fixed foundations:** brand green #53B175 and Poppins everywhere.\n- **Tokens I defined:** colour variables for text, surfaces, borders, semantic states, rating, social buttons and category tints, plus spacing and radius variables, Poppins text styles and three shadow levels.\n- **Components:** icons; button types and states; add-to-cart button; quantity stepper; favourite on/off; product card; category cards; section header; search bar; promo banner; location label; screen headers; tab bar with each of the five tabs active; cart item; product detail rows; checkout rows; account row; code input; phone field (+880 with the flag); next button.\n- **Supplied parts reused:** the default Button, Text Field, status bar and home indicator from 02 · Components, and all the photos, icons, logo, flag, illustration and avatar from 04 · Media. The copy and prices follow the brief's fixed data.\n\n**Prototype:** 26 interactions, starting from the \"Nectar · Full flow\" starting point on 01_Splash.\n- **Sign-in flow:** Splash moves on automatically after 1.5 s (a tap also works). Get Started → 03, and the phone number field → 04. On 04, back → 03 and next → 05.\n- **Home:** Red Apple → 06. On 06, back → 05 and Add To Basket → 09.\n- **Explore:** Beverages → 08. On 08, back → 07.\n- **Checkout:** Go to Checkout on 09 opens 10 as an overlay. Close (or tapping the dimmed area) → 09, and Place Order → 11. Back to home on 11 → 05.\n- **Tabs:** On 05, 07, 09 and 12, the Shop, Explore, Cart and Account tabs link to each other. On Home the header, tab bar and status bar stay fixed while the page scrolls.\n- **Entry-only controls:** The Favourite tab and the other controls the brief lists as entry only (See all, share, filter, Resend Code, social sign-in, Track Order and so on) have no links, as the brief specifies.\n\n**Limitations**\n- **Checkout background:** 10_Checkout_Overlay shows the cart through a static copy of 09 behind a dimmed layer. That copy won't update if 09 is edited later.\n- **Workspace contents:** Besides the 12 screens, the workspace also contains the components section. There are no extra screens."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":100823,"cache_read_input_tokens":7702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":100823,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd50dcd8-43a9-4829-85c3-1ee90c619584","uuid":"7dbc9041-ff13-4280-b6b3-aed3f6fdacf5","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:04:44.999Z"}
